OL,3,GNEWSANewspaper archive to remain online
OL,4,A- for now
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of newspapers documenting
OL,7,Fmore than 150 years of Isle of Man
OL,8,Fhistory are to remain available on the
OL,9,Finternet.
OL,11,FThe online newspaper archive, which is
OL,12,Fmanaged by Manx National Heritage
OL,13,F(MNH), holds a collection of more than
OL,14,F400,000 pages of newsprint dating from
OL,15,F1792 to 1960.
OL,17,FThe service was due to be switched off
OL,18,Fthis week after the software and server
OL,19,Fbecoming obsolete.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
FL,449,445,260,140,0,100
